From 0c34617ca25e3a33aad4124816833152bc37dfc2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: redducc <sushmit718@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:33:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add the MyUI volume panel style

A narrow glass column by the volume keys that expands into a centred Sound & vibration card of thin sliders, in light and dark.
---
